WFC Identification & Follow-up

Identify Welcome Calls to be performed, create and track their e-folders, and monitor their progress through two complementary views: Last e-Folder, showing the latest e-folder for each call, and All e-Folders, providing the complete history of e-folders created for all calls.

Dashboard

Monitor key Welcome Call KPIs and trends, including monthly volumes, completion rates and operational performance. The WFC After SL List provides a detailed view of Welcome Calls performed after the lease start date, to support monitoring and investigation of exceptions.

Documentation

Access the definitions and business rules supporting the Welcome Call process. Formula & Rules provides KPI definitions and e-folder status descriptions, while e-Folder Code Definition explains the available e-folder codes, their purpose and when to use them throughout the process.
